Many thanks to all who answered. This conference is something unbeliavable -
I got eight answers during the first 20 minutes after sending my question.
Some people adviced not to do it, some others told: try it.

I decided not to do it and to wait until the machine was free. The main
reason was the posibility of  some garbage running through the wires into
the controller and into the PCI bus.

