same SCSI ID) and go. Nothing more. No /dev creating, no kernel rebuilding.
The TZ89 can be connected to various SCSI controllers without any care - as
I remember from the documentation - fast wide differential, single-ended,
narrow... And the result? The backup of 81 GB SAP/Oracle data lasts 3
