This list is certainly alpha powered!

The answer came just 1 minute later from
Finn Rasmussen (fra@kemi.aau.dk).

The solution is to check for ".AM_is_running" or
ptmp (both in /etc) and delete them. (In my case the first one)
I don't realy know what this file is and what or who
created it, but now everything is back to normal.

