X-MARC-Message: https://marc.info/?l=tru64-unix-managers&m=96079079016108

All..

Apologies for the late summary.

Some while ago, I queried setting of the LCD display on DS20's -
specifically with respect to the ocp_text console variable NOT working (as
it does on other systems).

various people - too many to mention - said they had experienced similar
problems.

The every helpful Dr Tom came through with a solution as follows:

==========================================================================
There's a bug in the ocp_text code that prevents it from working as
expected.  We'll fix it in the V5.6 release of the DS20 console.

Try to use the "oem_string" environment variable, this may give
the desired result.

	>>>set oem_string "Node: xxx"
	>>>init

==========================================================================

This works a treat.


regards - Tony


