Sorry to have to post this to everyone, but...

When I joined this list two weeks ago, there were some extremely
high-quality posts--and I thank everybody for the great summaries, and
all. But, the last few days, I've seen stuff that's in the man pages. 
Here's some general-purpose advice:

1. If you know what command you want, but need help with syntax:

man command

2. If you don't know what command you want, but have an idea of what you
want to do:

man -k keyword

The answer to the passwd question is definitely in there.  If your man
pages aren't installed, that should be your first order of business,
before posting here! Sorry! Thanks!

Bonnie Scott

